<title>MEXICO: Mexican markets closed for Constitution Day.</title>
<headline>Mexican markets closed for Constitution Day.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican financial markets are closed Wednesday for Constitution Day, with local trading resuming as normal on Thursday.</p>
<p>Banks, government offices, schools and most of the country's businesses are also closed for the holiday.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287902))</p>
